      "message": "Mm, just think that for the uuid \u003d\u003e Hypervisor conversion, maybe we can just implement `impl TryFrom\u003cu128\u003e for HypervisorBackend` or `impl TryFrom\u003cUuid\u003e for HypervisorBackend`?",
