      "writtenOn": "2023-04-17T07:35:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1. It\u0027s more clear to have HYPERVISOR as `Option` type and rename `detect_hypervisor` to `init_hypervisor`.",
      "parentUuid": "d642c881_a7284fbc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 73,
